ALTERED SOURCE: this is not the original Box2D. In Box2D/Common/b2Settings.h
b2_linearSlop (0.005 -> 0.05), b2_timeToSleep (0.5 -> 0.25) and
b2_linearSleepTolerance (0.01 -> 0.1) were changed to match the physics
settings of the game this project reimplements.
